{"3323800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "3 Nights of Terror", "steam_appid": 3323800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Straight into the horror: intense survival horror with realistic action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Nights of Terror</strong> is a realistic survival horror game that throws you into three completely different scenarios. Each night brings unique mechanics, challenges, and threats. From noise-based stealth in a claustrophobic environment to brutally intense weapon combat with highly realistic gunplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scott Harris is a police officer with the Rockville PD. For years he’s dealt with dangerous streets, but now the real fight is happening in his own head. He suffers from a rare form of parasomnia – a disorder that drags him into violent, exhausting nightmares night after night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In three days, he’s scheduled for an experimental surgery, his last chance to put an end to it. Until then, Harris has to make it through three more nights and whatever his mind throws at him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each night, it gets harder to tell what’s real and what’s just in his head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>Night 1: The Maze</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harris wakes up in a sprawling underground maze. The only way out is to bring the power back online, but he’s not alone down there. Something moves through the ventilation, drawn to every noise. The louder you get, the closer it comes. Until the silence breaks and you realize it’s already hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e89507b9705261ecdba1c2b4c0fa1156.poster.avif?t=1777286918\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e89507b9705261ecdba1c2b4c0fa1156.webm?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e89507b9705261ecdba1c2b4c0fa1156.mp4?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Night 2: The Hospital</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in his own bed, Harris realizes that something is off about his surroundings. Upon further investigation, he finds himself in a pitch-dark hospital, which is occupied by a blind monster that reacts to sound. Since his only light source is the Flash of an old camera, he must put a lot of thought in each of his actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/67f7b8f216122a53f2e368101dde8451.poster.avif?t=1777286918\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/67f7b8f216122a53f2e368101dde8451.webm?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/67f7b8f216122a53f2e368101dde8451.mp4?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Night 3: The Shelter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In his last nightmare before surgery, Harris is dispatched to a hostage call. The scene is an abandoned shelter crawling with danger. Armed with his service pistol, he has no choice but to push forward, cut down anything in his way, and reach the civilians hiding in the panic room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e94860eb8d3784133965c10e49f4394d.poster.avif?t=1777286918\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e94860eb8d3784133965c10e49f4394d.webm?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e94860eb8d3784133965c10e49f4394d.mp4?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied gameplay: </strong>Every night plays differently. New mechanics, fresh dangers, and challenges that keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere that doesn’t let go: </strong>Claustrophobic tunnels, pitch-black halls, sudden silence, each setting is built to keep the tension high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters that adapt: </strong>With every night a new creature shows up, each one reacting in its own way and forcing you to change tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools that define the level: </strong>An interactive map, a camera flash, or your service pistol. What you carry changes how you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Straight into the horror: intense survival horror with realistic action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Nights of Terror</strong> is a realistic survival horror game that throws you into three completely different scenarios. Each night brings unique mechanics, challenges, and threats. From noise-based stealth in a claustrophobic environment to brutally intense weapon combat with highly realistic gunplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scott Harris is a police officer with the Rockville PD. For years he’s dealt with dangerous streets, but now the real fight is happening in his own head. He suffers from a rare form of parasomnia – a disorder that drags him into violent, exhausting nightmares night after night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In three days, he’s scheduled for an experimental surgery, his last chance to put an end to it. Until then, Harris has to make it through three more nights and whatever his mind throws at him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each night, it gets harder to tell what’s real and what’s just in his head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>Night 1: The Maze</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harris wakes up in a sprawling underground maze. The only way out is to bring the power back online, but he’s not alone down there. Something moves through the ventilation, drawn to every noise. The louder you get, the closer it comes. Until the silence breaks and you realize it’s already hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e89507b9705261ecdba1c2b4c0fa1156.poster.avif?t=1777286918\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e89507b9705261ecdba1c2b4c0fa1156.webm?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e89507b9705261ecdba1c2b4c0fa1156.mp4?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Night 2: The Hospital</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in his own bed, Harris realizes that something is off about his surroundings. Upon further investigation, he finds himself in a pitch-dark hospital, which is occupied by a blind monster that reacts to sound. Since his only light source is the Flash of an old camera, he must put a lot of thought in each of his actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/67f7b8f216122a53f2e368101dde8451.poster.avif?t=1777286918\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/67f7b8f216122a53f2e368101dde8451.webm?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/67f7b8f216122a53f2e368101dde8451.mp4?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Night 3: The Shelter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In his last nightmare before surgery, Harris is dispatched to a hostage call. The scene is an abandoned shelter crawling with danger. Armed with his service pistol, he has no choice but to push forward, cut down anything in his way, and reach the civilians hiding in the panic room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e94860eb8d3784133965c10e49f4394d.poster.avif?t=1777286918\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e94860eb8d3784133965c10e49f4394d.webm?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/extras/e94860eb8d3784133965c10e49f4394d.mp4?t=1777286918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied gameplay: </strong>Every night plays differently. New mechanics, fresh dangers, and challenges that keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere that doesn’t let go: </strong>Claustrophobic tunnels, pitch-black halls, sudden silence, each setting is built to keep the tension high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters that adapt: </strong>With every night a new creature shows up, each one reacting in its own way and forcing you to change tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools that define the level: </strong>An interactive map, a camera flash, or your service pistol. What you carry changes how you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "3 Nights of Terror is an intense survival-horror experience with unique mechanics for each nightmare: sneak through a sound-based labyrinth, survive with only a camera in a pitch-black hospital, and endure brutal, realistic weapon combat in the final night.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain, Russian, French, Turkish, Italian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/e1412704a1df7e4d3f09e485d5b81a2ba209cbaa/header.jpg?t=1777286918", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/bf10d0eb5ec4a817fcdb1fb6e2fa754058cd63a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777286918", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/bf10d0eb5ec4a817fcdb1fb6e2fa754058cd63a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777286918", "website": "https://rehoga-interactive.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core I7-4790 / Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not Supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> IMPORTANT: This game requires hardware ray tracing for proper lighting and atmosphere. The game might run on a GTX 1060, but only on the lowest possible settings. This will lead to the whole scene being super bright, which will break immersion. It also supports all major controllers via Steam Input. Please note that certain puzzles require mouse interaction. By default, Steam Input often maps L1/R1 (Left/Right Bumper) to Mouse Scroll Up/Down. This mapping does not work correctly in the game. We recommend remapping these buttons to alternative keys in the Steam Input settings for the best experience.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I7-10700 / Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce RTX 3070 TI<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not Supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> IMPORTANT: This game requires hardware ray tracing for proper lighting and atmosphere. The game might run on a GTX 1060, but only on the lowest possible settings. This will lead to the whole scene being super bright, which will break immersion. It also supports all major controllers via Steam Input. Please note that certain puzzles require mouse interaction. By default, Steam Input often maps L1/R1 (Left/Right Bumper) to Mouse Scroll Up/Down. This mapping does not work correctly in the game. We recommend remapping these buttons to alternative keys in the Steam Input settings for the best experience.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["SichelBichel"], "publishers": ["ReHoGa Interactive"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 799, "final": 799, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$7.99"}, "packages": [1176849], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy 3 Nights of Terror", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1176849, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "3 Nights of Terror - $7.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 799}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 13, "description": "Captions available"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323800/4980f0f0a198c32232b20cf9c99d13d15d4bda